                        <field name="dc_description">They come from a family of infanzones hijosdalgo of the villa of Tauste, settle in Cosuenda, where they begin the lawsuit of infanzony, claiming that their predecessors, Miguel López de Ancierto and Francisco López de Ancierto, obtained a signature of infanzony in the Court of Justice Mayor, in 1701. The lawsuit ends with the judgment of July 3, 1797, “granting license to print it in vellum with some exemplars” (20) </field>
